{
  "title": "25th Day",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "اَللّٰهُمَّ اجْعَلْنِىْ فِيْهِ مُحِبًّا لِاَوْلِيَآئِكَ، وَ مُعَادِيًا لِاَعْدَآئِكَ، مُسْتَنًّا بِسُنَّةِ خَاتَمِ اَنْبِيَآئِكَ، يَا عَاصِمَ قُلُوْبِ النَّبِيِّيْنَ.\nALLAAHUMMAJ A'LNEE FEEHE MOHIBBAN LE-AWLEYAA-EKA WA MO-AADEYAN LE-A-A'DAA-EKA MUSTANNAN BE-SUNNATE KHAATAME AMBEYAA-EKA YAA A'ASEMA QOLOOBIN NABIYYEEN.\nO Allah, on this day, (please) make me bear love for Your intimate servants, bear enmity towards Your enemies, and follow the instructions of the seal of Your Prophets. O Protector of the Prophet’s hearts!"
}
